From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Flores <eddyflores100@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: replace go.uber.org/atomic with sync/atomic (#20673)

Go 1.19 added typed atomic types (`atomic.Bool`, `atomic.Int64`,
etc.) to the standard library, making the third-party
`go.uber.org/atomic` package redundant.

This patch:
1. Replaces all `atomic.*` types from `go.uber.org/atomic` with the
   standard `sync/atomic` equivalents.
2. Removes `go.uber.org/atomic` from go.mod.
3. Removes the staticcheck rule that suppressed SA1019 warnings for
   this package.

Closes #20673.

---
 go.mod                                    |   1 -
 go.sum                                    |   1 -
 internal/util/atomic.go                   |  18 +++++++----------
 pkg/iter/sharded.go                        |  12 +++++------
 ... (and other files with go.uber.org/atomic usage)
 18 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 92 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -42,7 +42,6 @@ require (
 	github.com/segmentio/fasthash v1.0.3
 	github.com/sercand/kubernetes-guard v1.0.0
 	github.com/sirupsen/logrus v1.9.3
-	go.uber.org/atomic v1.11.0
 	golang.org/x/sync v0.10.0
 	google.golang.org/grpc v1.69.0
 )
diff --git a/internal/util/atomic.go b/internal/util/atomic.go
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/internal/util/atomic.go
+++ b/internal/util/atomic.go
@@ -3,16 +3,14 @@ package util
 import (
 	"sync"
-	"go.uber.org/atomic"
+	"sync/atomic"
 )
 
-// AtomicBool wraps go.uber.org/atomic.Bool for backward compat.
-// Should be replaced with sync/atomic.Bool when minimum Go version
-// is bumped to 1.19+.
-type AtomicBool = atomic.Bool
+// AtomicBool wraps sync/atomic.Bool.
+type AtomicBool = atomic.Bool
 
-// AtomicInt64 wraps go.uber.org/atomic.Int64.
-type AtomicInt64 = atomic.Int64
+// AtomicInt64 wraps sync/atomic.Int64.
+type AtomicInt64 = atomic.Int64
 
-// AtomicDuration wraps go.uber.org/atomic.Duration.
-type AtomicDuration = atomic.Duration
+// AtomicDuration wraps sync/atomic.Int64 to store time.Duration values.
+type AtomicDuration = atomic.Int64
-- 
